flowchart LR
    U[Operador local]
    W[PyWebView]
    M[main.py\nFlask server en 127.0.0.1:5000]
    APP[create_app\nFlask-Login / Flask-Migrate]
    R[Blueprint main\nroutes.py]
    S[services.py\nreglas de dominio]
    AUD[audit.py\ncadena SHA-256]
    ORM[SQLAlchemy ORM]
    DB[(SQLite local)]
    MIG[Alembic\nmigrations/versions]
    FS[Carpetas locales\nbackups / data / logs / exports]

    U --> W --> M --> APP
    APP --> R
    R --> S
    R --> AUD
    S --> ORM
    S --> AUD
    AUD --> ORM
    ORM --> DB
    M --> MIG
    MIG --> DB
    APP --> FS
    M --> FS
